  m_Description: "Born from a mishap in an alchemist\u2019s experiment, the Chemical
    Slimes first emerged when a potion spilled into a murky swamp. That alchemical
    accident seeped into the waters, infusing the marsh with strange energies and
    giving rise to these gelatinous, glimmering beings. Now they dwell quietly in
    the swamp, a lingering testament to that experiment gone awry."
